WEBVTT

00:13.200 --> 00:19.910
<b>Banished from the Hero's Party,
I Decided to Live a Quiet Life in the Countryside 2nd</b>

01:30.730 --> 01:32.980
<b>The Conclusion and
the Start of a New Journey</b>

01:34.570 --> 01:36.550
Martial Art: Swallow's Approach!

01:45.340 --> 01:46.160
Van!

01:47.400 --> 01:49.210
You're not going anywhere.

01:51.160 --> 01:52.780
Don't you...

01:58.180 --> 02:00.430
Don't you get in my way!

02:06.970 --> 02:09.250
Die!

02:28.720 --> 02:31.400
Van... Van...

02:34.960 --> 02:37.680
She's far more powerful than 
anyone could've imagined.

02:37.680 --> 02:40.090
We can't let her out of there.

02:40.400 --> 02:42.340
We'll stop her!

02:56.900 --> 02:58.870
Lightning of Judgment!

03:01.990 --> 03:04.330
Don't you dare!

03:05.280 --> 03:06.620
Sacred Shield.

03:27.060 --> 03:27.840
Martial Art:

03:28.930 --> 03:31.690
Great Whirlwind!

04:08.940 --> 04:10.690
I win!

04:10.690 --> 04:13.260
Healing Hands Mastery... Reflection!

04:16.630 --> 04:18.300
I've been waiting for that.

04:33.700 --> 04:35.540
Guess I win.

04:35.920 --> 04:39.290
Was that the Hero's power?

04:40.220 --> 04:41.380
Yeah.

04:41.380 --> 04:44.780
Ruti imbued the ornament 
with it before the battle.

04:44.780 --> 04:48.350
Even the ultimate skill can be countered 
by another of the same kind.

04:52.240 --> 04:53.380
That's cheating...

04:54.400 --> 04:58.060
Van, you're fundamentally mistaken.

04:59.840 --> 05:03.320
Sure, I'm the Guide and you're the Hero,

05:03.870 --> 05:07.450
but before that, this is a
 fight between two men.

05:07.920 --> 05:10.770
It can't be won by focusing
 solely on the Blessings.

05:10.770 --> 05:13.450
They are only a part of what 
makes each person who they are.

05:15.000 --> 05:15.960
Damn it!

05:16.350 --> 05:17.870
That's it, Van.

05:17.870 --> 05:21.960
It was that emotion that 
was making you waver.

05:23.230 --> 05:27.970
You felt like you lost to me when 
we fought the sea bogeys, right?

05:28.550 --> 05:31.510
You thought you couldn't 
have saved the kid alone,

05:31.510 --> 05:35.810
that you didn't deserve the 
gratitude she showed you.

05:36.340 --> 05:40.230
In that moment, you felt the emotion 
called disappointment for the first time.

05:41.120 --> 05:43.980
So this is disappointment...

05:45.360 --> 05:46.610
That's right.

05:47.130 --> 05:50.310
Let's talk again once you wake up.

05:59.340 --> 06:00.880
Van! Van!

06:01.800 --> 06:03.990
Wake up, Van!

06:07.870 --> 06:08.870
Van!

06:09.850 --> 06:11.160
Lavender...

06:12.990 --> 06:14.010
Where are we?

06:19.440 --> 06:19.980
Oh?

06:21.090 --> 06:22.050
You're awake?

06:22.610 --> 06:24.000
Gideon...

06:24.000 --> 06:26.620
Hey! What are you people playing at?

06:26.620 --> 06:28.670
I can't get close to Van!

06:28.670 --> 06:31.990
Hurry up and untie me!

06:33.720 --> 06:35.840
Deal with it for a bit.

06:35.840 --> 06:38.690
We can't untie you and have 
you going berserk again.

06:38.690 --> 06:41.390
Grr! You'll pay for this!

06:41.390 --> 06:43.460
You were given emergency magical healing.

06:43.870 --> 06:45.040
How do you feel?

06:46.460 --> 06:48.220
Not great.

06:48.730 --> 06:52.430
Yeah, it sucks to lose to someone 
you didn't want to lose to.

06:52.960 --> 06:55.200
Says the victor.

06:57.690 --> 07:00.690
Oh, how are Albert and Ljubo?

07:00.960 --> 07:02.740
They're both fine.

07:02.740 --> 07:07.690
Albert has come to,
 and Cardinal Ljubo is recovering.

07:06.460 --> 07:07.690
Curses!

07:07.970 --> 07:10.680
But there took a while
 before he got treatment,

07:10.680 --> 07:12.580
so he'll be stuck in bed for a while.

07:15.520 --> 07:16.700
Because of me.

07:25.380 --> 07:27.200
Hey, what gives?

07:27.200 --> 07:29.430
The two of us are going outside.

07:29.430 --> 07:32.020
I want to talk to him alone. Sorry.

07:32.020 --> 07:35.050
If you hurt my Van, I'll beat you up!

07:35.050 --> 07:37.590
Kick your butt!

07:37.590 --> 07:39.740
Pulverize you!

07:39.740 --> 07:42.230
Are you listening me? Say something!

07:45.980 --> 07:47.170
How's your Blessing?

07:47.720 --> 07:49.360
Back to normal, it seems.

07:50.000 --> 07:52.260
I can feel the impulse.

07:53.130 --> 07:55.870
So I won't try to hurt anyone anymore.

07:56.310 --> 07:57.260
I see.

08:06.260 --> 08:12.350
The sudden emotional turmoil must've 
made your Blessing go berserk.

08:13.680 --> 08:15.460
Emotional turmoil...

08:17.920 --> 08:22.190
Yeah, I'd never felt disappointment before.

08:23.780 --> 08:26.730
Does that mean I'm not fit to be a Hero?

08:30.270 --> 08:30.950
Van.

08:31.770 --> 08:35.160
The Blessing isn't what makes someone the Hero.

08:35.910 --> 08:39.160
The Hero is someone who tries to act like one.

08:39.700 --> 08:41.170
What do you mean?

08:41.810 --> 08:45.740
Always considering what 
it takes to be the Hero,

08:45.740 --> 08:47.920
listening to advice at times,

08:48.520 --> 08:52.920
wavering and worrying, 
and yet trying to act like the Hero

08:53.370 --> 08:55.070
is what makes the Hero in my eyes.

09:04.340 --> 09:05.320
Then...

09:06.880 --> 09:08.330
What am I supposed to do?

09:10.560 --> 09:11.990
Well...

09:12.750 --> 09:16.180
You're too ignorant of the ways of the world.

09:16.180 --> 09:19.210
You lack perspective, 
which is why your sword is weak.

09:19.210 --> 09:20.640
Weak?!

09:20.640 --> 09:23.990
All you ever do is try 
to win with brute force.

09:23.990 --> 09:25.910
A simple counter can take you down.

09:29.470 --> 09:30.680
That's just it.

09:32.270 --> 09:33.920
You're fine that way.

09:34.470 --> 09:38.290
Understand your emotions and accept 
that you're human, first and foremost.

09:38.290 --> 09:40.930
That might make you weaker in the moment.

09:41.400 --> 09:45.140
But when you trust your friends 
and give meaning to your sword,

09:45.140 --> 09:46.850
you will grow much stronger.

09:47.280 --> 09:50.520
That's when you will truly become the Hero.

09:52.540 --> 09:54.940
The true Hero...

09:55.390 --> 09:58.300
Try trusting in Esta some more.

09:58.830 --> 10:00.960
Not just in matters pertaining to your duty.

10:00.960 --> 10:02.950
Talk to her about all sorts of things.

10:03.660 --> 10:08.460
Would Esta really be willing 
to travel with me again?

10:08.890 --> 10:12.990
As long as you desire to be 
the Hero, I'm sure she will.

10:13.530 --> 10:15.980
Because she's there to guide the Hero.

10:17.340 --> 10:18.470
She is?

10:18.970 --> 10:23.730
She doesn't have the Blessing, 
but she has the desire.

10:24.160 --> 10:30.070
If she didn't, she wouldn't have traveled 
with a brat like you to begin with.

10:34.460 --> 10:36.030
That's mean.

10:37.150 --> 10:39.760
But you're probably right.

10:45.120 --> 10:46.490
Gideon...

10:47.260 --> 10:50.150
Would you come with me?

10:50.150 --> 10:52.550
I'm Ruti's Guide.

10:52.550 --> 10:55.100
I don't plan on teaming up
 with an new Hero.

10:57.010 --> 10:58.100
That's too bad.

10:58.990 --> 11:02.720
I wish I could have met you before 
awakening the Hero's Blessing.

11:08.600 --> 11:09.260
Van.

11:10.790 --> 11:12.730
When did your Blessing change?

11:13.420 --> 11:15.010
How do you know that?

11:15.010 --> 11:20.300
You didn't show up as the Hero while 
we were fighting the demon lord's army.

11:20.910 --> 11:23.300
You were living in a 
monastery back then, right?

11:24.770 --> 11:26.660
You see through everything, huh?

11:27.520 --> 11:28.650
You're right.

11:28.650 --> 11:32.750
I originally had the Divine Blessing 
of the Cardinal, just like Ljubo.

11:33.290 --> 11:36.500
But it suddenly changed one day.

11:38.170 --> 11:41.320
I believed it was a miracle 
Lord Demis granted me.

11:42.630 --> 11:46.480
And that I had to give up 
everything to be the Hero.

11:47.990 --> 11:49.240
Oh, man.

11:49.710 --> 11:53.720
You had to suddenly change paths and 
lead a completely different life.

11:53.720 --> 11:55.000
That must've been hard.

11:55.450 --> 11:56.110
It was.

11:57.960 --> 12:00.970
So, what are you planning on doing now?

12:00.970 --> 12:02.720
Are you going to leave immediately?

12:02.720 --> 12:03.890
Of course I...

12:04.920 --> 12:05.660
No.

12:07.320 --> 12:10.780
I think I should consult my party first.

12:18.480 --> 12:19.330
Lavender.

12:20.080 --> 12:20.890
Van!

12:22.320 --> 12:24.400
Did he do anything weird to you?

12:24.400 --> 12:26.300
No, I'm fine.

12:26.840 --> 12:28.010
Also...

12:29.780 --> 12:35.090
Lavender, thank you for 
always being by my side.

12:37.410 --> 12:40.980
Aw, it's my pleasure.

12:49.380 --> 12:50.410
Pardon me.

12:55.450 --> 12:56.630
How do you feel,

12:56.960 --> 12:57.870
Cardinal Ljubo?

12:58.280 --> 12:59.330
Hmph!

12:59.330 --> 13:01.360
They took away my drinks and my cigars.

13:01.360 --> 13:03.240
How do you think I feel?

13:04.600 --> 13:06.130
I see you're doing just fine.

13:08.010 --> 13:11.890
Van came to see me and 
asked for my forgiveness.

13:12.530 --> 13:15.570
He said he wanted me to accompany 
him on his travels again.

13:15.570 --> 13:17.630
And what was your answer?

13:17.630 --> 13:19.360
I forgave him, of course.

13:19.360 --> 13:21.900
No matter how many problems 
he causes or sins he commits,

13:21.900 --> 13:24.400
Van is the Hero, 
and there is no changing that.

13:25.130 --> 13:29.160
I need the Hero to fulfill 
my divine ambitions.

13:30.560 --> 13:34.000
I didn't expect the prideful 
Van to apologize, though.

13:34.000 --> 13:36.980
You put him up to it, didn't you?

13:36.980 --> 13:39.170
All I did was hear him out.

13:39.510 --> 13:44.250
It was Van who felt bad about the things 
he'd done and wanted to apologize.

13:44.760 --> 13:47.680
He also went and spoke 
to Albert and the mayor.

13:55.420 --> 13:58.380
They were all shocked by his change of heart.

13:59.480 --> 14:03.840
I'd love to add Gideon, who changed 
Van so much, to our party,

14:03.840 --> 14:06.190
but that's not going to happen, is it,

14:07.060 --> 14:08.660
Theodora Dephilo?

14:09.930 --> 14:11.340
Who might that be?

14:13.180 --> 14:14.750
You're a terrible liar.

14:24.200 --> 14:24.880
Oh!

14:25.280 --> 14:26.900
Sir Hewo!

14:29.680 --> 14:31.200
What do you want?

14:31.200 --> 14:33.900
The kids are all afraid of you.

14:36.430 --> 14:38.410
I came to apologize for that.

14:39.000 --> 14:41.310
I'm sorry about before.

14:43.310 --> 14:48.570
I think I should've tried to 
get to know you all better.

14:51.880 --> 14:53.650
Let's pway togeda!

14:57.390 --> 14:58.010
Sure.

15:00.800 --> 15:02.480
Yay!

15:02.480 --> 15:05.480
Let's pway, Sir Hewo!

15:11.110 --> 15:12.970
What's the meaning of this?!

15:13.320 --> 15:17.330
Why does Van have to go around 
apologizing to people?

15:17.330 --> 15:20.270
He's the one who wanted to, isn't he?

15:20.270 --> 15:25.010
Yeah, but my Van's becoming 
a different person!

15:27.150 --> 15:28.800
Do you dislike him now?

15:28.800 --> 15:30.500
Of course not!

15:30.500 --> 15:31.490
If anything, I love—

15:34.650 --> 15:37.490
This wasn't supposed to be happen.

15:39.110 --> 15:41.250
I just remembered I have some good mead.

15:41.760 --> 15:43.300
Let's talk about it over drinks.

15:43.300 --> 15:45.840
Good idea! Bring some snacks, too!

15:45.840 --> 15:48.770
Sure. Give me a bit.

15:59.660 --> 16:00.830
All done.

16:00.830 --> 16:01.950
Hey.

16:02.790 --> 16:04.860
Lavender. I didn't know you were here.

16:05.610 --> 16:08.330
Just so you know, I hate you.

16:08.330 --> 16:11.890
I'll never forgive you for hurting Van.

16:11.890 --> 16:14.530
Hey, he cut me, too. We're even.

16:14.530 --> 16:16.280
Boo!

16:16.280 --> 16:17.880
Take this!

16:23.680 --> 16:24.710
Wait, what?!

16:25.320 --> 16:27.460
This is a blue sapphire!

16:27.730 --> 16:30.210
As thanks for looking after Van.

16:31.530 --> 16:34.120
How did you get this?

16:34.120 --> 16:35.840
When I drank with Rit last time,

16:35.840 --> 16:39.340
she mentioned that you were looking for 
a gem to put in her engagement ring.

16:39.340 --> 16:44.480
I could get my hands on gold or whatever 
if I asked the fairies, so I did just that.

16:45.500 --> 16:47.150
Archfay are amazing, huh?

16:47.440 --> 16:49.650
I'll allow you to worship at my altar.

16:50.210 --> 16:51.310
Thanks.

16:51.310 --> 16:53.910
Hmph! Don't you dare mess this up!

16:56.560 --> 16:59.120
Huh? Where'd you go, Lavender?

16:59.120 --> 17:01.690
I'm right here! Let's get drinking!

17:01.690 --> 17:03.840
Have some patience, will you?

17:10.390 --> 17:12.670
Whoa.

17:13.090 --> 17:16.960
I've seen my fair share of blue sapphires, 
but this has got to be the best one ever.

17:16.960 --> 17:19.680
I can make you the greatest 
engagement ring ever with this.

17:19.990 --> 17:21.250
Really?

17:22.150 --> 17:23.910
You've got time, right?

17:23.910 --> 17:24.690
Yeah.

17:24.690 --> 17:26.280
Come on in.

17:26.280 --> 17:28.690
I'm closing up shop for the day.

17:29.130 --> 17:32.570
Hey, Mink! Get my jeweler's tools for me!

17:32.570 --> 17:34.350
Actually, I'll get them myself!

17:34.350 --> 17:36.000
You stay put!

17:36.000 --> 17:39.120
What are you doing, Red? Get over here!

18:03.810 --> 18:04.800
There.

18:08.210 --> 18:10.560
Dinner's ready, Rit.

18:11.190 --> 18:12.320
Coming.

18:27.300 --> 18:28.070
Huh?

18:29.240 --> 18:31.790
Is today something important?

18:32.120 --> 18:34.250
Nah, that's not it.

18:44.090 --> 18:45.770
I want to give you something.

18:52.540 --> 18:54.520
Is that a blue sapphire?

18:55.840 --> 18:57.580
Wait, is this...

18:57.580 --> 18:58.170
Rit!

18:58.170 --> 18:59.280
Y-Yesh?!

18:59.610 --> 19:01.980
If you don't mind, could you...

19:05.420 --> 19:06.230
Nah.

19:07.730 --> 19:08.740
That's not right.

19:13.940 --> 19:14.960
Please.

19:16.540 --> 19:18.300
Marry me.

19:20.160 --> 19:21.300
Red...

19:21.810 --> 19:23.500
I love you, Rit.

19:24.620 --> 19:28.850
I've been in love with you ever 
since I met you in Loggervia.

19:38.430 --> 19:43.910
I'm no hero at this point, and I may not 
be a good match for a princess like you.

19:44.760 --> 19:48.130
But I promise to make you 
as happy as I possibly can.

19:48.600 --> 19:52.350
I'll wake you up every 
morning with breakfast.

19:53.220 --> 19:54.270
I promise you that.

19:56.730 --> 19:57.470
Okay...

20:02.370 --> 20:04.590
I should be the one asking you.

20:05.220 --> 20:08.600
Please marry me.

20:09.670 --> 20:12.500
I swear all my love to you.

20:13.190 --> 20:16.550
Even when we're all old and wrinkly,

20:18.610 --> 20:21.430
I will be there by your 
side as long as I live.

20:22.030 --> 20:22.680
Thanks.

20:36.600 --> 20:37.960
I'm so happy.

20:39.700 --> 20:40.960
It's a dream come true!

20:43.800 --> 20:44.850
Red!

20:48.350 --> 20:49.280
Rit.

21:02.250 --> 21:04.000
Congrats!

21:02.250 --> 21:04.000
Congratulations!

21:05.340 --> 21:06.640
Thanks, guys.

21:06.640 --> 21:08.640
Way to go, Red.

21:08.640 --> 21:13.760
Spending time in Zoltan has helped me 
realize that you two really are happy here.

21:13.760 --> 21:14.960
Thanks.

21:13.760 --> 21:14.960
Thanks.

21:16.100 --> 21:16.950
Rit.

21:17.880 --> 21:22.460
Thanks for bringing my dear friend happiness.

21:24.470 --> 21:28.440
I never expected Red and the 
Champion Rit to end up engaged.

21:29.350 --> 21:30.720
People change.

21:30.720 --> 21:33.290
You've changed a lot yourself.

21:33.290 --> 21:33.980
Huh?

21:35.660 --> 21:38.420
What was she like in the past?

21:38.420 --> 21:39.710
I'd love to know more!

21:39.710 --> 21:40.340
Wait...

21:39.710 --> 21:41.070
I'd like to know, too.

21:41.070 --> 21:41.660
What?

21:41.070 --> 21:41.660
Van!

21:41.660 --> 21:43.130
I'll fill you in.

21:43.130 --> 21:47.020
I heard she saw Ruti and the others 
as threats back when they first met.

21:47.020 --> 21:47.730
What?!

21:47.730 --> 21:49.170
We are not talking about that!

21:49.170 --> 21:50.430
Big Brother.

21:49.170 --> 21:50.990
Albert, tell us more about yourself instead!

21:52.480 --> 21:56.500
My heartfelt congratulations, Red, Rit.

21:58.280 --> 21:59.560
Thanks.

21:59.560 --> 22:02.500
You two look really happy together.

22:03.200 --> 22:05.760
And that gives me so much joy.

22:06.160 --> 22:07.430
Ruti...

22:07.430 --> 22:11.220
Hearing that from you makes it all worth it.

22:11.660 --> 22:14.390
Yeah. Next is my turn.

22:14.680 --> 22:15.730
Next?!

22:17.600 --> 22:20.040
I'll get you some more meat right away.

22:20.040 --> 22:22.280
Please don't. Due to my Blessing, 
I don't feel hunger or taste...

22:22.280 --> 22:23.520
Just you wait.

22:23.520 --> 22:25.820
I'll go get some more mead, too!

22:28.190 --> 22:29.940
Next is my turn.

22:29.940 --> 22:32.020
Don't let her beat you 
to the punch, Esta!

22:32.020 --> 22:33.240
Huh? What?

22:34.130 --> 22:36.500
<i>The Hero's journey will be 
paved with difficulties.</i>

22:37.530 --> 22:39.640
<i>I know that all too well.</i>

22:43.710 --> 22:48.370
<i>But, unlike Ruti,
Van wishes to fight.</i>

22:46.650 --> 22:47.880
Cheers!

22:49.660 --> 22:52.080
<i>I don't have it in me to say 
that his desire is mistaken.</i>

22:55.420 --> 22:57.340
<i>Before the Hero goes on his way,</i>

22:57.840 --> 22:59.740
<i>I think I'll continue
to play my part</i>

22:59.740 --> 23:02.270
<i>in Van the Hero's story
just a bit more.</i>

23:05.620 --> 23:06.530
Van.
